  "label": "audience description",
  "description": "The target community for this meme is individuals who are familiar with and may find amusement in racist stereotypes and racialized humor, particularly those who engage with or perpetuate anti-Black tropes. The meme is designed to appeal to an audience that understands the derogatory nature of the term 'nigga' and the mocking implication that a Black person's skin is so dark it requires a white background to be visible. This audience likely includes people who consume internet memes that rely on offensive racial caricatures, and who may be drawn to the meme’s punchline through its reinforcement of harmful anti-Black stereotypes. The meme’s hateful intent suggests it is targeted at those who either do not recognize the racism or who actively enjoy such content, thereby reinforcing systemic prejudice.",
